{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "賢劫第四尊"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或云成道于臘月八日，以周正二月，乃夏正臘月也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦名優波崛多，又名鄔波毱多"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "汾陽\n注曰：素潔條然"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "運機非面目"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蕩盡玲瓏性"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "塵泥自異"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "汾陽曰：妙智理圓融"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無間功不立"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "旁觀審騰距，爭功不自傷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "全力能負，\n不露頭角"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
